This might be too little too late.

Looks like the problem might be that the URL should be

mywebsite.com/rscripts/hello-world.R <http://mywebsite.com/rscripts/hello-world.R>

instead of

mywebsite.com/rscripts <http://mywebsite.com/rscripts>

